This directory is based on AlphaFold 3 v3.0.4, commit
85c4d20505fd5cef05eac22b534d4e793971ae69, from
https://github.com/google-deepmind/alphafold3 (DeepMind Technologies Limited),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 -- see LICENSE beside this file.

All carried Python/C++ source files match that commit byte-for-byte except the
following explicit FoldJAX runtime patches:

- alphafold3/constants/chemical_components.py
- alphafold3/data/pipeline.py
- alphafold3/model/confidences.py
- alphafold3/model/features.py
- alphafold3/model/model.py
- alphafold3/model/network/diffusion_head.py
- alphafold3/structure/chemical_components.py
- alphafold3/structure/parsing.py

They redirect generated chemistry and bounded caches to the managed runtime,
isolate per-job cache/RNG state, and bound sample/confidence memory. The exact
allowlist is enforced against an upstream checkout by the test suite.

Model parameters are not included and are not redistributable: they are
licensed separately by Google under the terms at
https://github.com/google-deepmind/alphafold3/blob/main/WEIGHTS_TERMS_OF_USE.md
and must be requested there, then placed in the FoldJAX weight store.

Excluded from the vendored tree: test data, the generated chemical-component
pickles (built into the FoldJAX store instead), and compiled artifacts. Copies
of the repository-level parameter/output terms are also retained inside the
package so they remain present in built wheels.
